description	"Mercenary Thug 

A multi-life hybrid brawler that can spec into Sabering upgrades, melee, explosives and abilities.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
- Acidic Vibroaxe (Yellow Saber)
-- Saber Defense (0)
-- No Blaster Block
-- Chain Limit: 2
-- Poisons on hit
-- 33% more Radius
> BD-1 Cutter Vibroaxe
-- 20% more Kb
-- 10% less Reach
> BD-1 Cutter Short Vibroaxe
-- 15% more Kb
-- 15% more AS
-- 40% less Reach

^8Attributes:
- Reinforcement (1)
- Stamina (2)
- Assemble (3)

^3Abilities:
- Sprint ^3[CS1]"